    "long_instructions": "#Milestone Two: Rendering your UI\r\n\r\n**Goal**: Design a clear, accessible interface that displays your dataset using .map()\r\n\r\n1.  **Wirefames:** Import your Sketch Lab wireframes of the full-page and card views 2.  \r\n2.  **Create the UI:** Use saved CHAT prompts and PAIR programming techniques to work with AI to render your UI based on the wireframes that you designed.\r\n3.  **Connect to Data:** Render your dataset within the cards.\r\n4.  **Test:** Make sure that your UI is set-up properly and that each card shows the correct info.\r\n",
